  apply it. It would then generate some type of storm such as hurricane, 
  tornado, or lightning storm. Then those would follow you around wherever 
  you went like this:
  
      ---------
      |.......| 
      |.......| 
      |  , <-------Storm
      | ,@,...|
      |..,....|
      ---------
